    ('august-16-part-2', '[{"key":"healthy-change","title_en":"A personal change in progress","title_ja":"続けている自分の変化","description_en":"A health or concentration goal and the changes you are making to reach it.","description_ja":"健康や集中力に関する目標と、その達成に向けて行っている変化","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about a health or concentration goal and the changes you are making to reach it. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"健康や集中力に関する目標と、その達成に向けて行っている変化について60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about a health or concentration goal and the changes you are making to reach it. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"健康や集中力に関する目標と、その達成に向けて行っている変化について100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["I’m trying to …","I’ve put on …","It’s hard to concentrate …"],"vocabulary":["weight","concentrate","habit","improve"]},{"key":"workplace-change","title_en":"Growth and cuts at work","title_ja":"職場での増加と削減","description_en":"A workplace change involving growth, a larger or smaller budget and the final result.","description_ja":"成長・予算の増減・最終結果を含む職場の変化","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about a workplace change involving growth, a larger or smaller budget and the final result. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"成長・予算の増減・最終結果を含む職場の変化について60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about a workplace change involving growth, a larger or smaller budget and the final result. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"成長・予算の増減・最終結果を含む職場の変化について100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["The company is growing …","They increased …","We need to cut …"],"vocabulary":["growth","increase","budget","result"]},{"key":"rain-and-noise","title_en":"Hard conditions, hardly audible","title_ja":"大雨と聞こえにくい状況","description_en":"A noisy situation during heavy rain, using hard, hardly, heavy and heavily accurately.","description_ja":"大雨の中で音が聞こえにくかった状況を、hard・hardly・heavy・heavilyで正確に説明すること","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about a noisy situation during heavy rain, using hard, hardly, heavy and heavily accurately. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"大雨の中で音が聞こえにくかった状況を、hard・hardly・heavy・heavilyで正確に説明することについて60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about a noisy situation during heavy rain, using hard, hardly, heavy and heavily accurately. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"大雨の中で音が聞こえにくかった状況を、hard・hardly・heavy・heavilyで正確に説明することについて100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Stretch","phrases":["It’s raining heavily.","We had heavy rain.","I could hardly hear …"],"vocabulary":["heavily","hardly","noise","audible"]}]'::jsonb),
    ('august-17-part-1', '[{"key":"symptom-duration","title_en":"How long you have felt unwell","title_ja":"体調不良が続いている期間","description_en":"A mild health problem, when it began and how long it has continued.","description_ja":"軽い体調不良がいつ始まり、どのくらい続いているか","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about a mild health problem, when it began and how long it has continued. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"軽い体調不良がいつ始まり、どのくらい続いているかについて60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about a mild health problem, when it began and how long it has continued. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"軽い体調不良がいつ始まり、どのくらい続いているかについて100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["I’ve had … since …","I’ve been feeling … all day.","How long have you had …?"],"vocabulary":["headache","symptom","since","duration"]},{"key":"study-duration","title_en":"A study session in progress","title_ja":"続いている学習時間","description_en":"What you have been studying, its starting time and its total duration.","description_ja":"何を勉強しているか、開始時刻と合計時間を含めた説明","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about what you have been studying, its starting time and its total duration. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"何を勉強しているか、開始時刻と合計時間を含めた説明について60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about what you have been studying, its starting time and its total duration. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"何を勉強しているか、開始時刻と合計時間を含めた説明について100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["I’ve been studying since …","I’ve been studying for …","I’m taking a short break now."],"vocabulary":["study","since","for","continuous"]},{"key":"changing-routine","title_en":"An old and a new routine","title_ja":"昔の習慣と新しい習慣","d