    ('august-17-part-2', '[{"key":"describe-and-identify","title_en":"Describing and identifying an item","title_ja":"物を描写して持ち主を確認する","description_en":"How you would describe a piece of clothing or another item and find its owner.","description_ja":"服や持ち物の特徴を説明し、その持ち主を確認する方法","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about how you would describe a piece of clothing or another item and find its owner. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"服や持ち物の特徴を説明し、その持ち主を確認する方法について60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about how you would describe a piece of clothing or another item and find its owner. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"服や持ち物の特徴を説明し、その持ち主を確認する方法について100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["She’s wearing …","Whose … is this?","Whose is this?"],"vocabulary":["sleeveless","describe","owner","identify"]},{"key":"whole-story","title_en":"The whole work, in its entirety","title_ja":"全体を漏れなく伝える","description_en":"A book, report or performance, using entire, entirely and entirety in their correct forms.","description_ja":"本・レポート・公演について、entire・entirely・entiretyを正しい形で使うこと","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about a book, report or performance, using entire, entirely and entirety in their correct forms. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"本・レポート・公演について、entire・entirely・entiretyを正しい形で使うことについて60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about a book, report or performance, using entire, entirely and entirety in their correct forms. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"本・レポート・公演について、entire・entirely・entiretyを正しい形で使うことについて100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["The … was written …","The entire …","I read it in its entirety."],"vocab